{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"standards\": [\n    {\n      \"std\": \"1\",\n      \"verdict\": \"过\",\n      \"note\": \"只读线即可看出一个人从克制表达、逐渐靠近，到暴露在乎、害怕失去，最后接受不确定的完整经历；没有依赖珠子补充事件或前史。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"std\": \"2\",\n      \"verdict\": \"过\",\n      \"note\": \"前面的克制、被看见后的不安、对方没有退开带来的安定、逐渐接受自己的感情，都成为后续发展的理由，情绪有连续的生长和回返，不是原地打转。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"std\": \"3\",\n      \"verdict\": \"过\",\n      \"note\": \"整条经历始终围绕亲密带来的幸福、对亲密无法长久维持的担忧，以及明知无法保证仍愿意投入展开，贴合 Center。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"std\": \"4\",\n      \"verdict\": \"有问题\",\n      \"note\": \"整体对应关系基本成立，但 S05-B3 的松开、放下没有在线里找到明确的对应处境。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"std\": \"底线\",\n      \"verdict\": \"过\",\n      \"note\": \"主要句子的意思和人物处境都读得清楚，没有会让下一步沿着错误意思改写的明显歧义。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"std\": \"形态\",\n      \"verdict\": \"过\",\n      \"note\": \"各段均有此刻与 Center 的关系标注，前文回指注明出处，条目均为完整自然的句子，基本各自承载一个连贯的意思。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"issues\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"std\": \"4\",\n      \"quote\": \"珠子 S05-B3：「此前还像要用力抱紧对方、牢牢抓住当下；到了这里，音乐却仿佛自己松开了手，深吸一口气。刚才那阵想攥紧不放的冲动，终于轻轻退了下去。」；线 S05-3：「他忍不住担心对方会嫌自己太黏，连原本熟悉的亲近，在他心里也像忽然隔了一层。」\",\n      \"why\": \"珠子的关键体验是抓紧的冲动退去、松开手、紧张有所缓解；线里写的却仍是担心被嫌弃，以及亲近感产生隔阂，没有明确写出他从想抓紧转为松开、放下的心理变化。下一步若要呈现这颗珠子的体验，需要自行补出一层退让或放下的心理过程。\",\n      \"severity\": \"中等\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3b851d37-aa74-4113-a7a9-e69f9b77548a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T174453424441Z", "elapsed_seconds": 264.86, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T17:49:18.304612+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1f65545a9927814d8b3295c2cf85377f4bbaffe9c764796541cc0ce4d16a2e37", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T174453424441Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "9e66a6a9e870375547cdb193f08cd5df0b77ade0224d1c845348b0c53d3ee37c"}}}
